  "id": "USN-8362-1",
  "summary": "xz-utils vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that XZ Utils did not properly manage memory when\nattempting to append data to a decoded index that contained no records.\nAn attacker could possibly use this issue to cause XZ Utils to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service, or execute arbitrary code.",
